# Live-LLM lane: the LOCAL opt-in and settings. Its absence is the closed-firewall default, so it must
# never be committed (an accidentally-committed "enabled": true would let a clone or CI spend tokens).
# The committed livellm.settings.example.json is the template.
livellm.settings.json
